ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2023-08-08T20:37:14Z","updated_at":"2023-11-03T18:33:50Z","closed_at":"2023-10-18T20:18:05Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-7542](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7542)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nOriginally found during testing with dynamic tablet splitting but turned out to be reproducible even with single tablet without splitting with the following test:\r\n```\r\nTEST_F(PgRowLockTest, SelectForKeyShareWithRestart) {\r\n  auto conn = ASSERT_RESULT(Connect());\r\n  ASSERT_OK(conn.Execute(\"CREATE TABLE t(k INT, v INT) SPLIT INTO 1 TABLETS;\"));\r\n  ASSERT_OK(conn.Execute(\r\n      \"INSERT INTO t SELECT i, 1 FROM (SELECT generate_series(1, 10000) i) t2;\"));\r\n  ASSERT_OK(cluster_->FlushTablets());\r\n\r\n  ASSERT_OK(conn.StartTransaction(IsolationLevel::SNAPSHOT_ISOLATION));\r\n  for (int i = 0; i < 10; ++i) {\r\n    ASSERT_OK(conn.FetchFormat(\"SELECT * FROM t WHERE k=1 FOR KEY SHARE;\", i));\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  ASSERT_OK(cluster_->RestartSync());\r\n\r\n  ASSERT_OK(conn.CommitTransaction());\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIntent value decoding fails during loading transactions (`TransactionLoader::Executor::Execute`) that is happening on opening tablet. Also fails for `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`. It fails with the following error: \r\n\r\n`Expecting hybrid time with ValueType kHybridTime, found <unknown KeyEntryType : 50>`\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-7542]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7542?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"basavaraj29","id":17742021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQyMDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17742021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29","html_url":"https://github.com/basavaraj29","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basavaraj29/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/18615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/18615/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}